{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1191344-what-would-happen-if-a-changing-escapes-from-acradia-and-into-the-shadow-realm","id":1191344,"title":"What would happen if a changing escapes from acradia and into the shadow realm","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Changeling: The Lost"],"posts":[{"date":"2018-03-03T07:48:53-08:00","id":1191344,"title":"What would happen if a changing escapes from acradia and into the shadow realm","content":"The books imply that the other realms are all connected and you may be able to go thoug them to get to earth . Maybe a werewolf/wolves find them and rescuers them, how would spirts react to a changling I think they can sense a difference","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23952-konradleijon","name":"Konradleijon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23952_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1441"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-03T09:01:12-08:00","id":1191360,"title":"","content":"Well. There is actually a very simple answer to this. Werewovles may have pulled a Changeling or 3 out of the fire a few times. The simple truth though is that spirits would probably treat the changeling like and invader, or spy for an invader.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/21.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/600-haplesswithdice","name":"HaplessWithDice","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar600_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1234"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-03T10:26:24-08:00","id":1191378,"title":"","content":"H,, maybe some changlig goblins are spies for some bored true fae, maybe they\u2019ll act diffrent like a elemental water changling in seen as oddly humanoid kin for some water spirts and they help them escape though a magic lake that takes them to earth","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23952-konradleijon","name":"Konradleijon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23952_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1441"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-03T10:53:06-08:00","id":1191386,"title":"","content":"If a Water Spirit thinks you're also a Water Spirit and you dont have an honorary Rank above its own, its gonna try to eat you.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>A god is just a monster you kneel to. </b>- ArcaneArts, Quoting &quot;Fall of Gods&quot; <div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/6.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7920-master-aquatosic","name":"Master Aquatosic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7920_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2369"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-03T11:03:53-08:00","id":1191394,"title":"","content":"I wonder what would happen them what happens when a spirt eats a changling ? And I think some spirt aren\u2019t alowwed to eat essence from the spirt king of the habit. Also all spirts are unpredteble a spirt Alllied to the elemental water court could think the changling is a spirt","signature":"","edited":{"userid":23952,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23952-konradleijon","user":"Konradleijon","date":". 03-03-2018, 02:06 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23952-konradleijon","name":"Konradleijon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23952_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1441"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-03T12:28:25-08:00","id":1191414,"title":"","content":"A spirit....couldn't actually eat a Changeling? They can only &quot;eat&quot; other spirits because they're all made of Essence; Changelings can <i>produce</i> Essence (like any other living thing), but are still physical matter. So the whole mistaken identity would end pretty much as soon as the actual spirit tried to take a bite. (Like if you tried to take a bite of a delicious chocolate cake, only to discover it was made of wood)<br /> <br /> As for the initial question, I think HaplessWithDice has the right of it- a newly-free Lost could plausibly stumble from the Hedge into the Shadow (or perhaps even directly from Arcadia), but likely will quickly run afoul of the native spirits. If they're lucky, they might run across some werewolves. If they're <i>really</i> lucky, those werewolves might be persuaded/bribed/tricked/etc. into taking the Changeling back to the physical world with them.<br /> <br /> I think that might work as a nice origin story for a <i>Lost</i>/<i>Forsaken</i> crossover chronicle, where the Changeling(s) was under the thumb of a Keeper who liked to hunt, and had a secret gateway directly into the Shadow. The Lost used that portal in their escape, and fell in with the Forsaken pack on the other side.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12970-gellydog","name":"Gellydog","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12970_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"140"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-03T13:26:07-08:00","id":1191432,"title":"","content":"Maybe a powerful spirt would KEEP the changling as a pet or curiosity\u2019 (;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23952-konradleijon","name":"Konradleijon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23952_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1441"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-03T15:14:32-08:00","id":1191460,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Gellydog</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1191344-what-would-happen-if-a-changing-escapes-from-acradia-and-into-the-shadow-realm?p=1191414#post1191414\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">A spirit....couldn't actually eat a Changeling? They can only &quot;eat&quot; other spirits because they're all made of Essence; Changelings can <i>produce</i> Essence (like any other living thing), but are still physical matter. So the whole mistaken identity would end pretty much as soon as the actual spirit tried to take a bite. (Like if you tried to take a bite of a delicious chocolate cake, only to discover it was made of wood)</div> </div> </div> </div>When people go into the shadow, their body is converted into essence. At least it did in Book of Spirits.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/904596-geniuses-and-gramarie\" target=\"_blank\">Genius templates</a>: Super Science Mini-Template for Demon: the Descent<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1337874-oracle-the-endbringers-fan-splat\" target=\"_blank\">Oracle the Endbringers</a>: Time-Manipulator Fan-Splat","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8331-milo-v3","name":"milo v3","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8331_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1505"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-03T16:04:21-08:00","id":1191467,"title":"","content":"Some spirts are Capcurus as hell maybe the don\u2019t like the true fae for stealing there shit? And know if the changling escapes they would cause harm or at least annoying to the true fae. Like a spirt can see a positive outcome for them if they guide the changling to the matrial world?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23952-konradleijon","name":"Konradleijon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23952_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1441"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-03T17:56:42-08:00","id":1191491,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>milo v3</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1191344-what-would-happen-if-a-changing-escapes-from-acradia-and-into-the-shadow-realm?p=1191460#post1191460\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">When people go into the shadow, their body is converted into essence. At least it did in Book of Spirits.</div> </div> </div> </div>I thought things convert into ephemera, not Essence? Eating ephemera-lized people won\u2019t give Essence, but spirits will probably do it any way as a means of attack, and hopefully generating Resonance to feed upon.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>MtAw Homebrew:<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1051456-even-more-legacies-updated-to-2e#post1051456\" target=\"_blank\">Even more Legacies, updated to 2E</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1443819-new-2e-legacies-expanded\" target=\"_blank\">New 2E Legacies, expanded</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12619-21c-hermit","name":"21C Hermit","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12619_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3489"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-03T17:59:52-08:00","id":1191492,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Konradleijon</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1191344-what-would-happen-if-a-changing-escapes-from-acradia-and-into-the-shadow-realm?p=1191467#post1191467\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Some spirts are Capcurus as hell maybe the don\u2019t like the true fae for stealing there shit? And know if the changling escapes they would cause harm or at least annoying to the true fae. Like a spirt can see a positive outcome for them if they guide the changling to the matrial world?</div> </div> </div> </div>Most spirits likely won\u2019t even know the True Fae exist, but smarter ones understand too well the concept of leveraging debts to cash in later. So yes, spirits who find changelings stumbling in the Shadow will guide them to the Flesh... for a price. Which won\u2019t be new for changelings; they too are familiar with deals and bargains.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>MtAw Homebrew:<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1051456-even-more-legacies-updated-to-2e#post1051456\" target=\"_blank\">Even more Legacies, updated to 2E</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1443819-new-2e-legacies-expanded\" target=\"_blank\">New 2E Legacies, expanded</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_l