Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Maybe a powerful spirt would KEEP the changling as a pet or curiosity\u2019 (;</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Imagine dealing with that. You've managed to break out of Arcadia, only to go right into the clutches of another alien entity.<br /> <br /> Maybe one not quite as twisted or powerful as the last, but the point remains.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12200-blitzmentalist","name":"BlitzMentalist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12200_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-04T20:13:02-08:00","id":1191821,"title":"","content":"Speaking of which, are there any 2E Kiths related to spirits? I couldn\u2019t back the kickstarter, so no preview for me...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>MtAw Homebrew:<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1051456-even-more-legacies-updated-to-2e#post1051456\" target=\"_blank\">Even more Legacies, updated to 2E</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1443819-new-2e-legacies-expanded\" target=\"_blank\">New 2E Legacies, expanded</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12619-21c-hermit","name":"21C Hermit","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12619_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3489"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-04T20:55:17-08:00","id":1191827,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>21C Hermit</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1191344-what-would-happen-if-a-changing-escapes-from-acradia-and-into-the-shadow-realm?p=1191821#post1191821\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Speaking of which, are there any 2E Kiths related to spirits? I couldn\u2019t back the kickstarter, so no preview for me...</div> </div> </div> </div>In a very broad sense, Helldivers, whose blessing allows them to become semi-ephemeral and open otherworldly gates as though they were Hedgeways, but nothing specific to spirits, no.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-04T21:03:40-08:00","id":1191829,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Satchel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1191344-what-would-happen-if-a-changing-escapes-from-acradia-and-into-the-shadow-realm?p=1191827#post1191827\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> In a very broad sense, Helldivers, whose blessing allows them to become semi-ephemeral and open otherworldly gates as though they were Hedgeways, but nothing specific to spirits, no.</div> </div> </div> </div>Ah, I think I read about them somewhere in this forum. Thanks. <br /> <br /> <br /> Hmm... it seems that with things like Hedge Ghosts, oneiroi (that\u2019s what dream-creatures are still called, right?), and the myriad kinds of hobgoblins and Huntsmen and Gentry, I get the feeling that Changeling is more... self-contained, in the sense there\u2019s not much connecting them to the broader supernatural world in the CofD. Sorta like Vampire.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>MtAw Homebrew:<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1051456-even-more-legacies-updated-to-2e#post1051456\" target=\"_blank\">Even more Legacies, updated to 2E</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1443819-new-2e-legacies-expanded\" target=\"_blank\">New 2E Legacies, expanded</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12619-21c-hermit","name":"21C Hermit","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12619_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3489"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-04T21:25:21-08:00","id":1191831,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>21C Hermit</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1191344-what-would-happen-if-a-changing-escapes-from-acradia-and-into-the-shadow-realm?p=1191829#post1191829\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Hmm... it seems that with things like Hedge Ghosts, oneiroi (that\u2019s what dream-creatures are still called, right?),</div> </div> </div> </div>Eidolons, now, which are just dream-actors modeled like Hedge ghosts without frailties or the powers specific to Hedge ghosts. (Hedge ghosts themselves have innate mechanics allowing them to ride and steer dreams for Glamour, but the way the Dreaming Roads and the Gates of Horn work means &quot;dream-creature&quot; is a much less distinct category.)<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <span style=\"font-family:inherit\">and the myriad kinds of hobgoblins and Huntsmen and Gentry, I get the feeling that Changeling is more... self-contained, in the sense there\u2019s not much connecting them to the broader supernatural world in the CofD. Sorta like Vampire.</span> </div> </div> </div><span style=\"font-family:inherit\">Changeling is very definitely still a game that can present its own equivalent of a lot of the ground-level elements from other lines; the way Hedge ghosts operate, for instance, can stand in for ghosts and spirits alike.</span>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}